<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TUESDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TUESDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts at the French Open tennis championships on Tuesday (all matches quarter-finals. Matches start 1000 GMT):</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Magnus Norman (Sweden) v Filip Dewulf (Belgium)</p>
<p>3-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) v Gustavo Kuerten (Brazil)</p>
<p>1-Todd Woodbridge/Mark Woodforde (Australia) v Rick</p>
<p>Leach/Jonathan Stark (U.S.)</p>
<p>Tomas Carbonell/Francisco Riog (Spain) v Lucas Arnold/Daniel</p>
<p>Orsanic (Argentina)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>9-Iva Majoli (Croatia) v Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania)</p>
<p>11-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) v 2-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>3-Monica Seles (U.S.) v 12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v 6-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario</p>
<p>(Spain)</p>
<p>Joshua Eagle/Andrew Florent (Australia) v 2-Jacco Eltingh/Paul</p>
<p>Haarhuis (Netherlands)</p>
</text>
